sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Client
    participant GW as API Gateway :8080
    participant US as user-service :3001
    participant PS as product-service :3002
    participant OS as order-service :3003

    C->>GW: POST /api/v1/auth/login
    Note over GW: Auth rate limiter (10/15min)
    GW->>US: proxy → /v1/auth/login
    US-->>GW: { user, token }
    GW-->>C: 200 { user, token }

    C->>GW: GET /api/v1/products
    Note over GW: Public route (no JWT check)
    GW->>PS: proxy → /v1/products
    PS-->>GW: [ products array ]
    GW-->>C: 200 [...]

    C->>GW: POST /api/v1/orders/checkout\nAuthorization: Bearer JWT
    Note over GW: JWT verified\nx-user-id/role headers added
    GW->>OS: proxy with x-user-* headers
    OS-->>GW: { order, total }
    GW-->>C: 201 { order, total }

    C->>GW: GET /api/v1/orders/5/details
    Note over GW: API Composition
    par Parallel fetch
        GW->>OS: GET /v1/orders/5
    and
        GW->>PAY: GET /v1/payments/order/5
    end
    GW-->>C: { order, payments }
